    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game supports Mods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins with a dark invasion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goddess world with seven major planets is completely shrouded in darkness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goddesses are no match for the demons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The homes of goddesses have become playgrounds for demons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the alien Valkyrie Akashi and her friends perceive these anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They piloted the spaceship and broke through numerous obstacles to reach the world of the goddesses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are going to search for survivors who have not been contaminated by darkness, and gather the power of the goddesses to launch a new resistance against the dark forces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, a dazzling target - the Star Goddess - is fighting alone against darkness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We should go now! Go find her!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the game, you need to plan and use coins reasonably to enhance your combat</strong> effectiveness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack and Defense:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including maximum and minimum values, your ability will fluctuate between the maximum and minimum values</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic Value:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affects the activation of the goddess's scroll ability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critical Strike, Critical Strike Damage:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some weapons or props may have these effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will double your damage to enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are random and hidden items in the game, try opening treasure chests more often!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment and weapons are easier to enhance combat effectiveness than props, so work hard to find them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also move the collected items to the shortcut bar to use!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Finally, thank you to the loving CVs:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akashii - CV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reika Morimoto \u68ee\u672c\u9e97\u9999</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOOOM - CV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naoka Nakayama \u4e2d\u5c71\u5c1a\u83ef</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slen - CV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sho Nakatani \u4e2d\u8c37 \u7fd4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NaNa - CV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maika Tatsumi \u8fb0\u5df3\u821e\u9999</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hax - CV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sawa Ikebe \u6c60\u8fba\u6ca2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Light - CV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yukino Isoo \u78ef\u5c3e\u96ea\u4e43</p>",
